# Vercel uploads the project to the builder before running the build, so
# anything that is neither part of the site nor needed to assemble it is kept
# out. The repo is ~300MB; the site tree the build produces is ~34MB.
#
# tools/ stays - it holds build-site.sh, which is the build.
_source/
_deploy/
_reference/
Logo-Encik-Beku/
_site/
/Hero Image*
/*.png
/*.mp4
/*.mov
/*.md
/*.command
/*.code-workspace
